# HANGTEST=nandps1 (docs/kernel/nandboot_hang_analysis.md, hang 23): nandwdt
# + PSTORE and PSTORE_RAM only (no PSTORE_CONSOLE, PMSG or COMPRESS), and a
# ramoops with only its dmesg records: console-size, pmsg-size and ecc-size
# 0 (nandboot-nandps1.dts). Left: ramoops' mapping, the zap of its records
# and pstore's registration.
# DEBUG IMAGE ONLY: it arms a hardware watchdog, so each run needs the
# owner's OK.
CONFIG_CMDLINE="console=ttyS0,115200n8 marvell_nand.write_window=1741,4091 panic=10 consoleblank=0 timer_mv61x0.hang_wdt=30"
CONFIG_PSTORE=y
CONFIG_PSTORE_RAM=y
# CONFIG_PSTORE_CONSOLE is not set
# CONFIG_PSTORE_PMSG is not set
# CONFIG_PSTORE_COMPRESS is not set
